{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d6f502c6-f288-83e0-a3b9-266b6e67c94d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T11:26:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bruce Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. I want to report a noise problem. A truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure, I can take that down. What kind of truck, and where's it happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Delivery truck. Big box truck. It sits and idles. Engine running, twenty, thirty minutes. At dawn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no fun first thing in the morning. And where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "56 Carroll Avenue. That's my place. The truck parks out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 56 Carroll Avenue, that's up in the Fifth Ward. And how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two weeks. Every morning, pretty much. Maybe six, quarter past."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every morning for two weeks. Okay. Do you know whose truck it is? A company name on the side, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on. [pause] Sorry. I'm at the window. There's a school bus stopped up ahead of me right now. Flashing lights. Kids getting on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you're watching it as we speak? Well, take your time, the bus has the right of way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's going now. Anyway. No name on the truck I can read. White, with a red stripe. I think it delivers to the place on the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, white box truck, red stripe, probably delivering to the business on the corner. That helps. Do you know the time it usually shows up, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before six thirty. Sometimes earlier. It's loud. I'm eighty-some years old. I'm up early anyway, but I don't want to listen to that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I don't blame you. Have you talked to the driver or the business at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did once. Driver waved at me. Nothing changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, that's aggravating. Alright, so what I can do is take a report, with your address, the description, and the times, and I'll get it over to the right people to look into. Do you want that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's what I'm calling for. I want a report taken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Can I get your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bruce Wilcox. W-I-L-C-O-X."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Wilcox. And a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:42-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0177. Let me read it back. Bruce Wilcox, 56 Carroll Avenue, white box truck with a red stripe idling in front early in the morning, around six to six thirty, going on about two weeks. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I can't tell you exactly how fast someone will follow up, but it's on record as of today, Friday. If it happens again over the weekend or Monday, jot down the time and call us back so we can add it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've been writing the times down already. On the calendar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's perfect, that's exactly what they like to see. Keep doing that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Will somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody should reach out at that number if they need more. If you don't hear anything in a week or so, give us a ring and ask for me, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Wilcox. Hope you get some quiet mornings soon. You have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
